Package: dshift
Title: Distribution Shift Indicators from sdmTMB Simulation Draws
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jillian", "Dunic", , "jillian.dunic@dfo-mpo.gc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes distribution-shift indicators (abundance, log density, range edges, area occupied) from posterior simulation draws of sdmTMB projections, using a matrix-based calculations. Also summarises estimates and trends across draws.
